    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wandering Within</strong> is a survival game where you have to cross a hostile desert to unravel the mysteries of a legendary chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find water, food and make a firecamp, as the nights will be freezing. Build a variety of tools and find your way through an environment that will do anything to lose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a world rich in legends, strange places and characters who will guide you on your quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bar of hunger, thirst and warmth to be maintained at all times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is final, no room for error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tool-making system to increase your chances of survival</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NAVIGATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sense of direction will be severely tested</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the instructions of other desert dwellers to find the next point of interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiarise yourself with a procedurally generated environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep moving to ensure your survival</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEGEND</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the myths of the desert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher the mysteries surrounding a sealed chest containing immeasurable powers</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wandering Within</strong> is a survival game where you have to cross a hostile desert to unravel the mysteries of a legendary chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find water, food and make a firecamp, as the nights will be freezing. Build a variety of tools and find your way through an environment that will do anything to lose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a world rich in legends, strange places and characters who will guide you on your quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bar of hunger, thirst and warmth to be maintained at all times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is final, no room for error</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tool-making system to increase your chances of survival</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NAVIGATION</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sense of direction will be severely tested</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the instructions of other desert dwellers to find the next point of interest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiarise yourself with a procedurally generated environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep moving to ensure your survival</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEGEND</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the myths of the desert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decipher the mysteries surrounding a sealed chest containing immeasurable powers</p></li></ul>",
